---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro"; import FdeNav from "../../../components/FdeNav.astro"; import {fdeSegments} from "../../../data/fde";
---
<Base title="Eight FDE Segments | FDE Career Atlas" description="Compare eight Forward Deployed Engineering segments by what is deployed, technical expectations, customer proximity, and success metrics." pageSlug="fde-segments"><FdeNav/><div class="shell"><section class="head"><p class="eyebrow">THE CENTRAL FRAMEWORK</p><h1>Eight FDE segments.<br/>One question: what is being deployed?</h1><p>Use the product boundary—not the title—to predict the work. Select a segment for its technical stack, customer environment, success measure, and preparation path.</p></section><section class="matrix">{fdeSegments.map(s=><a href={`/career/segments/${s.slug}/`}><span>{s.number}</span><div><small>{s.accent} · DEPLOYS {s.deployed.toUpperCase()}</small><h2>{s.title}</h2><p>{s.short}</p><ul>{s.skills.slice(0,5).map(x=><li>{x}</li>)}</ul></div><b>Explore →</b></a>)}</section></div></Base>
<style>.head{padding:6rem 0 4rem}.head h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,6rem);max-width:15ch}.head>p:last-child{color:var(--fg-muted);max-width:60ch}.matrix{padding-bottom:6rem}.matrix>a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:4rem 1fr auto;gap:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:1.4rem;color:var(--fg)}.matrix>a:hover{text-decoration:none;background:#fff1e6}.matrix>a>span{font:500 2rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent-dim)}.matrix small{font:500 .62rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent)}.matrix h2{margin:.25rem 0}.matrix p{color:var(--fg-muted);font-size:.8rem}.matrix ul{display:flex;gap:.4rem;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:0}.matrix li{list-style:none;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:.2rem .4rem;font:400 .6rem var(--font-mono)}.matrix>a>b{align-self:center;color:var(--accent);font:500 .7rem var(--font-mono)}@media(max-width:600px){.matrix>a{grid-template-columns:2rem 1fr}.matrix>a>b{grid-column:2}.matrix>a>span{font-size:1rem}}</style>
